# phanes-control-workspace.ux.nt — dedicated Shrubbery workspace for the
# owner-only `phanes-control` graph on cloud-2 Canary.
#
# This is live graph configuration, not an embedded UI fallback. Deploy it at
# seed time by loading it into:
#   urn:mnemosyne:local:graph:phanes-control:ux:config
#
# The graph authors only layout and the admitted component identity. Trusted
# Organism code fixes the component's cross-graph capability to exactly
# `phanes-control`; copying these triples into another graph cannot confer the
# Phanes authority.
